    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 (Level 17) — Wheel of Fortune</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> —</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Once per strategic turn, after an outcome is revealed on a raid, campaign beat, travel encounter, or crisis table, your faction may <strong>force a reroll</strong> or <strong>choose between the rolled outcome and the rerolled one</strong>.</li></ul><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"wheelT4\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Force the Reroll</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Strategic Turn &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic (after outcome reveal) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">Force a reroll on a raid / beat / travel / crisis table, OR pick between rolled and rerolled outcome.</div>\n</div>",
